<title>ITALY: TENNIS-SICILIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SICILIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PALERMO, Sicily 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sicilian international</p>
<p>tennis championships quarter-final results on Friday:</p>
<p>Johan Van Herck (Belgium) beat Hicham Arazi (Morocco) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Marzio Martelli (Italy) beat Jordi Burillo (Spain) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Adrian Voinea (Romania) beat Alex Corretja (Spain) 6-4 6-2</p>
</text>
